(do train_new.py and eval_new.py work as expected?)


Trains an efficientnet_b4 (with ImageNet weights) on a public Kaggle dataset
(https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ascanipek/eyepacs-aptos-messidor-diabetic-retinopathy) that combines a number of
public DR datasets.

Best model weight is saved based on Quadratic Weighted Kappa.

ep25_size512 contains results of the model run with image size = 512.